ts (winner of the Raymond Crossword Book Award for Best Fiction 2014 and the Kendra Sahitya Akademi Award 2018), The Small-town Sea (winner of the Atta Galatta ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.hhousebooks.com/authors/\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"d2d9047859fe38fc51f12412fa3fc95c1ae3b272731e94a30ded75edc591ba6d\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"6863875c0ffd8403e74c7395d026f6f6ae0f5914ff7c149355ebfb5c54ace778\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"Man Asian Literary Prize 2010 2011 2012 2013 2014 2015 winner shortlist\",\"view\":\"full\"},{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d78\"},\"ref\":\"d78\",\"snippet\":\" ... The sculpture is a gift from alumni, parents, friends, and the Class of 2007 Senior Legacy.\\n\\n2007\\n\\nA gift from Judith Bryant Hale '56 and her husband Robert helps Thayer establish the Hale Learning Center to support students who face language-based learning challenges.\\n\\n2007\\n\\nThe house formerly ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.thayer.org/about/a-history-of-thayer\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d79\"},\"ref\":\"d79\",\"snippet\":\" ... the 2007–2008 season with a winless (0–16) conference record and overall record of 3–27.\\n\\nRice's mascot is Sammy the Owl. In previous decades, the university kept several live owls on campus in front of Lovett College, but this practice has been discontinued, due to ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rice_University\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d80\"},\"ref\":\"d80\",\"snippet\":\" ... Takeshobo launched \\\"Zeta Bunko\\\". (~2007)\\n\\n- It was an original novel-only label with a different policy from the company's \\\"Gamma Bunko\\\", which was discontinued in 1997.\\n\\n- It was discontinued the following year.\\n\\nNewcomer's Award\\n\\nShogakukan established the \\\"Shogakukan Light Novel Award,\\\" a newcomer award for light ... \",\"title\":\"https://robynpaterson.com/a-history-of-light-novels-the-2000s/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d5\"},\"ref\":\"d5\",\"snippet\":\" ... A Russian version of the Booker Prize was created in 1992 called the Booker-Open Russia Literary Prize, also known as the Russian Booker Prize. In 2007, Man Group plc established the Man Asian Literary Prize, an annual literary award given to the best novel by an Asian ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Booker_Prize\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d25\"},\"ref\":\"d25\",\"snippet\":\" ... 1935\\n\\nThe is a Japanese literary award presented biannually. Because of its prestige and the considerable attention the winner receives from the media, it is, along with the Naoki Prize, one of Japan's most sought after literary prizes.\\n\\nHistory\\n\\nThe Akutagawa Prize was established in 1935 by ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Akutagawa_Prize\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d81\"},\"ref\":\"d81\",\"snippet\":\" ... or Miniseries was established in 1972 and discontinued in 2007.\\n\\nSee also\\n\\n* Edogawa Rampo Prize\\n\\nReferences\\n\\nExternal links\\n\\n* (includes nominees)\\n* Mystery Writers of America\\n* Edgar Allan Poe Awards at IMDb\\n\\nCategory:Awards established in 1946\\nCategory:Mystery and detective fiction awards\\nCategory:American literary awards\\nCategory:Edgar Allan ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Edgar_Awards\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d60\"},\"ref\":\"d60\",\"snippet\":\" ... Among the most decorated American writers of his generation, he has won every major American literary award, including the Pulitzer Prize for his major novel American Pastoral (1997).\\n\\nIn the realm of African-American literature, Ralph Ellison's 1952 novel Invisible Man was instantly recognized as among the ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/American_literature\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d21\"},\"ref\":\"d21\",\"snippet\":\" ... It was shortlisted for the Governor General's Award (2006), the Griffin Poetry Prize (2007), and the Winterset Award for Excellence in Newfoundland Writing (2007).\\n\\nDec. 8 Film Screening/Launch - Redefining the Classroom\\n\\nThe Canadian Writers in Person Series has invited an impressive lineup of emerging and established ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.yorku.ca/laps/huma/canadian-writers/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d82\"},\"ref\":\"d82\",\"snippet\":\" ... In 2001, Haroon received the \\\"Outstanding Contribution to Asian Music\\\" award from the BBC Asia Awards show.\\n\\nHaroon released his third solo album, Haroon Ka Nasha in March 2007, again composed, recorded, produced, engineered and mixed by himself at his personal studio.\\n\\nThroughout his music career, Haroon has ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Haroon_%28singer%29\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d83\"},\"ref\":\"d83\",\"snippet\":\" ... Within a few years, the Rice Theatre Program was established (separating from Rice Players, a student run theatre club) in 2007.\\n\\n2004, English professor Justin Cronin established \\\"R2: The Rice Review,\\\" an undergraduate literary journal published annual in the spring.\\n\\n2005, The Campbell Lecture Series was established thanks ... \",\"title\":\"https://humanities.rice.edu/history-school-humanities\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"2c7a33c184d14467559d0f3b79b37823e63dd2fde1972b6c8b36af0d842ad035\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"8c8b62080c8e7ad696b6abf49611d9b94028125da55ed06173d37b413b2acbe3\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"Man Asian Literary Prize established 2007 discontinued\",\"view\":\"full\"}]}","role":"tool","tool_call_id":"call_a9051e2147f84b17b546d9f1"},{"content":"I have strong evidence about Chigozie Obioma (born in Akure, Nigeria; both novels shortlisted for the Booker Prize, translated into 30 languages). But the Booker Prize was established in 1969, not the 2000s. The puzzle says \"the award itself\" was \"originally created in the 2000s.\" Let me reconsider whether the puzzle might involve a different award, or whether I'm misreading the structure.\n\nLet me re-read the puzzle carefully:\n- Book A: contender for an award (the award itself created in the 2000s), translated into 25+ languages\n- In the 2010s, in the year Book A was published, another book (Book B, released the preceding year) won \"the very award above for which the first book was later in contention\"\n- Author of Book B was born in the same city where Author of Book A grew up\n- Question: where was Author of Book A born?\n\nThe phrase \"the very award above for which the first book was later in contention\" suggests the SAME award. So the award was created in the 2000s. The Man Asian Literary Prize (2007) fits. Let me check if Obioma's books were contenders for the Man Asian Literary Prize, and verify the connection. Let me search for the Man Asian Literary Prize Wikipedia page directly.","role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"queries\": [\"Man Asian Literary Prize\", \"Man Asian Literary Prize winners list\", \"Man Asian Literary Prize 2010 2011 2012 2013 2014 2015\"], \"top_k\": 10}","name":"search"},"id":"call_7b76593a677b4997a2c2872a","index":0,"type":"function"}]},{"content":"{\"action_slot_charged\":true,\"executed\":true,\"ok\":true,\"results\":[{\"cached\":true,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d29\"},\"ref\":\"d29\",\"snippet\":\"\",\"title\":\"https://www.aspeninstitute.org/blog-posts/20-new-works-fiction-social-impact/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d4\"},\"ref\":\"d4\",\"snippet\":\"\",\"title\":\"https://americanwritersmuseum.org/literary-links/literary-awards/?srsltid=AfmBOooYIGTV-EUbGd9xDLmBUtcV_Ts9VM7oqhh4K0lfwTLcUoKmITFg\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d57\"},\"ref\":\"d57\",\"snippet\":\"\",\"title\":\"https://www.bridgewaterpubliclibrary.org/award-winners\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d5\"},\"ref\":\"d5\",\"snippet\":\"\",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Booker_Prize\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_r